{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22771","headline":"得微之到官後书备知通州之事怅然有感因成四章 二 · 白居易","name":"得微之到官後书备知通州之事怅然有感因成四章 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"匼匝巅山万仞余，人家应似甑中居。\n寅年篱下多逢虎，亥日沙头始卖鱼。\n衣斑梅雨长须熨，米涩畲田不解鉏。\n努力安心过三考，已曾愁杀李尚书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22771.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22771","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}